    "spotify_canvas_setup_steps" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Melde dich in einem Browser bei open.spotify.com an.\n2. Öffne die Entwicklertools, dann Anwendung und Cookies.\n3. Kopiere den Wert des sp_dc-Cookies.\n4. Füge ihn unten ein."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Sign in at open.spotify.com in a browser.\n2. Open Developer Tools, then Application and Cookies.\n3. Copy the value of the sp_dc cookie.\n4. Paste it below."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Inicia sesión en open.spotify.com desde un navegador.\n2. Abre las herramientas de desarrollo, entra en Aplicación y luego en Cookies.\n3. Copia el valor de la cookie sp_dc.\n4. Pégalo abajo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Connectez-vous sur open.spotify.com dans un navigateur.\n2. Ouvrez les outils de développement, puis Application et Cookies.\n3. Copiez la valeur du cookie sp_dc.\n4. Collez-la ci-dessous."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. היכנס בכתובת open.spotify.com בדפדפן.\n2. פתח כלים למפתחים > Application > Cookies.\n3. העתק את הערך של העוגייה sp_dc.\n4. הדבק למטה."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. ब्राउज़र में open.spotify.com पर साइन इन करें।\n2. Developer Tools खोलें, फिर Application और Cookies पर जाएं।\n3. sp_dc कुकी की वैल्यू कॉपी करें।\n4. इसे नीचे पेस्ट करें।"
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Masuk di open.spotify.com melalui browser.\n2. Buka Developer Tools, lalu Application dan Cookies.\n3. Salin nilai cookie sp_dc.\n4. Tempel di bawah ini."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Accedi su open.spotify.com in un browser.\n2. Apri gli Strumenti per sviluppatori, poi Applicazione e Cookie.\n3. Copia il valore del cookie sp_dc.\n4. Incollalo qui sotto."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. ブラウザでopen.spotify.comにログインします。\n2. デベロッパーツールを開き、[Application]と[Cookies]を選択します。\n3. sp_dc cookieの値をコピーします。\n4. 下に貼り付けます。"
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Zaloguj się na open.spotify.com w przeglądarce.\n2. Otwórz Narzędzia deweloperskie > Application > Cookies.\n3. Skopiuj wartość ciasteczka sp_dc.\n4. Wklej ją poniżej."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Faça login em open.spotify.com no navegador.\n2. Abra Ferramentas de Desenvolvedor > Aplicação > Cookies.\n3. Copie o valor de sp_dc.\n4. Cole abaixo."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Войдите на open.spotify.com в браузере.\n2. Откройте инструменты разработчика, затем Application и Cookies.\n3. Скопируйте значение cookie sp_dc.\n4. Вставьте его ниже."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. ลงชื่อเข้าใช้ที่ open.spotify.com ในเบราว์เซอร์\n2. เปิดเครื่องมือสำหรับนักพัฒนา จากนั้นไปที่ Application และ Cookies\n3. คัดลอกค่าของคุกกี้ sp_dc\n4. วางไว้ด้านล่าง"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Bir tarayıcıda open.spotify.com'a giriş yapın.\n2. Geliştirici Araçları'nı, ardından Uygulama ve Çerezler'i açın.\n3. sp_dc çerezinin değerini kopyalayın.\n4. Aşağıya yapıştırın."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Đăng nhập tại open.spotify.com trong trình duyệt.\n2. Mở Công cụ cho nhà phát triển, sau đó vào tab Application và chọn Cookies.\n3. Sao chép giá trị của cookie sp_dc.\n4. Dán vào bên dưới."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. 在浏览器中登录 open.spotify.com。\n2. 打开开发者工具，然后进入“应用程序”和“Cookie”。\n3. 复制 sp_dc cookie 的值。\n4. 将其粘贴到下方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
